msgid ""
"If your autopilot has more than 3 compasses connected, you should disable or"
" change the priority on the least important one to allow this compass to be "
"used. Even then, you may wish to prioritize this compass higher than others,"
" or as the highest priority compass, due to its improved performance. See "
"Compass Advanced Configuration page."
msgstr ""
"如果飞控已连接超过 3 "
"个罗盘，应禁用或降低最不重要的一个的优先级，以便该罗盘能被使用。由于其性能更优，你可能还希望将该罗盘的优先级设置为高于其他罗盘，甚至设为最高优先级。请参阅罗盘高级配置页面。"

